{"title":"How Far I'll Go","artist":"Auli'i Cravalho (Moana OST)","date":"2026-08-18","sourceId":"14756908:013","sourceHash":"35556801863cf625c60e86b284d379e446f1cb7c0d27c8a547baa6f42877345e","duration":168.70000000000073,"cues":[{"id":"1","start":19.079448,"end":23.097597,"text":"I've been staring at the edge of the water","translation":"물가 끝을 바라본 지 오래야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"2","start":23.139764,"end":26.225,"text":"'Long as I can remember","translation":"기억이 닿는 때부터","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"3","start":26.490025,"end":28.665,"text":"Never really knowing why","translation":"왜인진 모르겠어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"4","start":30.830362,"end":34.475,"text":"I wish I could be the perfect daughter","translation":"완벽한 딸이 되고 싶은데","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"5","start":35.280709,"end":37.685,"text":"But I come back to the water","translation":"난 또 물가로 돌아와","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"6","start":38.110929,"end":41.005,"text":"No matter how hard I try","translation":"아무리 애써도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"7","start":42.461268,"end":43.825,"text":"Every turn I take","translation":"어느 쪽으로 돌아도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"8","start":43.951384,"end":45.115,"text":"Every trail I track","translation":"어떤 흔적을 따라가도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"9","start":45.471502,"end":46.989469,"text":"Every path I make","translation":"어떤 길을 새로 내도","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"10","start":47.021622,"end":48.045,"text":"Every road leads back","translation":"모든 길은 날 되돌려","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"11","start":48.451734,"end":51.309084,"text":"To the place I know where I cannot go","translation":"내가 아는 곳 갈 수 없는 곳으로","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"12","start":51.331958,"end":53.485,"text":"Where I long to be","translation":"내가 머물고 싶은 곳","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"13","start":54.122175,"end":56.325,"text":"See the line where the sky meets the sea?","translation":"하늘과 바다가 맞닿은 저 선 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"14","start":56.642371,"end":58.865,"text":"It calls me","translation":"날 부르고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"15","start":59.102563,"end":61.575,"text":"And no one knows","translation":"아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"16","start":62.002788,"end":64.605,"text":"How far it goes","translation":"얼마나 멀리 이어질지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"17","start":65.613069,"end":70.215,"text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","translation":"바다 위 내 돛의 바람이 나를 뒤에서 밀어준다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"18","start":70.523452,"end":73.325,"text":"One day I'll know","translation":"언젠간 알게 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"19","start":74.033725,"end":77.505,"text":"If I go, there's just no telling how far I'll go","translation":"내가 간다면 얼마나 멀리 갈지는 아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"20","start":77.69401,"end":80.905,"text":"I know everybody on this island","translation":"이 섬 사람들은 모두","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"21","start":81.284289,"end":84.015,"text":"Seems so happy on this island","translation":"이곳에서 행복해 보이는 걸 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"22","start":84.38453,"end":88.625,"text":"Everything is by design","translation":"모든 게 정해진 대로야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"23","start":88.75487,"end":92.77302,"text":"I know everybody on this island","translation":"이 섬 사람들은 모두","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"24","start":92.805186,"end":95.315,"text":"Has a role on this island","translation":"여기서 각자 맡은 일이 있는 걸 알아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"25","start":95.735414,"end":97.925,"text":"So maybe I can roll with mine","translation":"그러니 나도 내 몫에 맞출 수 있겠지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"26","start":99.645718,"end":101.208332,"text":"I can lead with pride","translation":"난 자랑스럽게 이끌 수 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"27","start":101.265844,"end":102.565,"text":"I can make us strong","translation":"우릴 강하게 할 수 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"28","start":102.795963,"end":105.355,"text":"I'll be satisfied if I play along","translation":"난 내 몫을 해내면 만족할 거야","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"29","start":105.58618,"end":108.309593,"text":"But the voice inside sings a different song","translation":"하지만 마음속 목소린 다른 노랠 불러","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"30","start":108.506408,"end":113.735,"text":"What is wrong with me?","translation":"내게 뭐가 잘못된 걸까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"31","start":113.996835,"end":116.185,"text":"See the light as it shines on the sea?","translation":"바다 위로 빛나는 저 빛 보여","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"32","start":116.567035,"end":118.915,"text":"It's blinding","translation":"눈이 부셔","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"33","start":119.147236,"end":121.675,"text":"But no one knows","translation":"아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"34","start":122.197473,"end":124.965,"text":"How deep it goes","translation":"얼마나 깊이 이어질지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"35","start":125.49773,"end":127.596097,"text":"And it seems like it's calling out to me","translation":"날 부르는 것만 같아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"36","start":127.737904,"end":130.265,"text":"So come find me","translation":"그러니 와서 날 찾아","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"37","start":130.50812,"end":133.544055,"text":"And let me know","translation":"그리고 내게 알려줘","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"38","start":134.168405,"end":135.405,"text":"What's beyond that line?","translation":"저 선 너머엔 뭐가 있을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"39","start":135.608517,"end":136.855,"text":"Will I cross that line?","translation":"내가 저 선을 넘을까","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"40","start":137.078631,"end":139.055,"text":"And the line where the sky meets the sea","translation":"하늘과 바다가 맞닿은 저 선은","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"41","start":139.49882,"end":141.805,"text":"It calls me","translation":"날 부르고 있어","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"42","start":142.149026,"end":144.495,"text":"And no one knows","translation":"아무도 몰라","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"43","start":145.109256,"end":147.875,"text":"How far it goes","translation":"얼마나 멀리 이어질지","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"44","start":148.219498,"end":153.57703,"text":"If the wind in my sail on the sea stays behind me","translation":"바다 위 내 돛의 바람이 나를 뒤에서 밀어준다면","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"45","start":153.599917,"end":156.035,"text":"One day I'll know","translation":"언젠간 알게 돼","kind":"lyric"},{"id":"46","start":156.320129,"end":164.72,"text":"How far I'll go","translation":"얼마나 멀리 갈지","kind":"lyric"}],"candidates":[],"reviewStatus":"draft"}